      "id": "claim_82dd87205fb94a30b8c6f7e1d2f3da65",
      "statement": "LLMClient is a capability contract rather than a uniform interface: only judge is abstract, while judge_batch and describe_image have concrete defaults that raise NotImplementedError, so an unsupported capability fails loudly instead of degrading silently into a response a caller would misread.",
