      "id": "claim_bc4e828e78d24a6898370b6a47e40be4",
      "statement": "ProviderLLM covers OpenAI, Azure OpenAI and Anthropic behind one class, branching only where the SDKs differ — a JSON response format for the OpenAI family versus an explicit token ceiling for Anthropic — and pins temperature to 0 for reproducibility, raising the Anthropic ceiling for batched calls that cover many criteria at once.",
