      "id": "claim_822d133d31ca49ee8e3eda404cfd20cb",
      "statement": "All providers parse model output through a shared three-tier _extract_json that strips a fenced code block, attempts a direct parse, then falls back to the substring between the first opening and last closing brace, because models routinely wrap structured output in prose or fences.",
