    {
      "id": "claim_99c1ec9f4be6489a915fc47c60717fc6",
      "statement": "ClaudeCLILLM provides judgment with no API key by delegating to an authenticated `claude` CLI subprocess, passing the prompt over stdin rather than argv because judgment prompts contain whole document sections that would exceed argument-length limits.",
