    {
      "id": "claim_28cca727ed7d4abc9d40c5c59a1d74fe",
      "statement": "The Claude CLI client checks two independent failure channels — a non-zero return code and the envelope's is_error flag on a successful exit — so an error payload returned with exit code 0 is not mistaken for a judgment.",
